(Tidewater Labs AB - Information Security Policy) Tj T*
(Document owner: Head of Operations | Version: 2024.1 | Approved: 2 April 2024) Tj T*
(Applies to: all employees, contractors and interns. Review cycle: yearly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Purpose) Tj T*
(This policy protects customer booking and payment data and the systems Tidewater Labs) Tj T*
(runs for its clients.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Accounts and passwords) Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 12 characters and stored in the company password manager) Tj T*
(\(Bitwarden\). Multi-factor authentication is required for all admin accounts. Shared) Tj T*
(accounts are not allowed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Laptops and devices) Tj T*
(Company laptops use full-disk encryption \(BitLocker or FileVault\) and lock the screen) Tj T*
(after 10 minutes of inactivity. Lost or stolen devices are reported immediately.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Access control) Tj T*
(Access is granted per role and removed on the last working day. Access rights are) Tj T*
(reviewed once a year. Production systems are only reachable through the company VPN.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Backups) Tj T*
(Production databases are backed up daily and backups are kept for 30 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Security incidents) Tj T*
(Anyone who suspects a security incident, such as a leaked password, a phishing click or) Tj T*
(unexpected access to customer data, reports it to security@tidewaterlabs.se within 72) Tj T*
(hours. Personal data breaches are assessed for notification to the data protection) Tj T*
(authority.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Roles) Tj T*
(The Head of Operations owns this policy and keeps it up to date. Managers make sure) Tj T*
(their team members have read it and understand it. Every employee and contractor is) Tj T*
(responsible for following it in their daily work.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Policy review) Tj T*
(This policy is reviewed once a year, or earlier after a serious incident or a change in) Tj T*
(the law. Changes are announced in the company channel and take effect 14 days after) Tj T*
(approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Exceptions and breaches) Tj T*
(Exceptions must be approved in writing by the Head of Operations and are reviewed at the) Tj T*
(next policy review. Breaches of this policy may lead to disciplinary action. Questions) Tj T*
(about this policy go to ops@tidewaterlabs.se.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
